examples DelveTalk 1
case repair and release
law maker visitor
as maker
send start
expect committed
as visitor
send choose
  choice (Nat): 1
expect refusal: source refused: choice unavailable
as maker
send choose
  choice (Nat): 2
expect refusal: source refused: The hinge refuses to bend.
as maker
send choose
  choice (Nat): 0
expect committed
as visitor
send choose
  choice (Nat): 1
expect committed
as visitor
send choose
  choice (Nat): 0
expect committed
